      "title": "Mix Seasonings",
      "direction": "Add 3g salt (½ tsp), 4g sugar (1 tsp), 0.5g dried oregano (⅛ tsp scant — measure, then crush in your palm), 3g garlic (1 very small clove, pinky-fingernail size, pressed), and 1g fresh basil (1.5 very small leaves, very finely chopped). Stir everything together.",
